{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06497","headline":"牧童词 · 储光羲","name":"牧童词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不言牧田远，不道牧陂深。\n所念牛驯扰，不乱牧童心。\n圆笠覆我首，长蓑披我襟。\n方将忧暑雨，亦以惧寒阴。\n大牛隐层坂，小牛穿近林。\n同类相鼓舞，触物成讴吟。\n取乐须臾间，宁问声与音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}